00:01:43.649 --> 00:01:48.529
Sandwich voters said no to becoming one city with Victoria, so the non-binding idea stops.

00:01:48.529 --> 00:01:50.809
Daily high Vancouver has the split.

00:01:51.349 --> 00:02:00.049
Sandwich cast 24,663 votes against, 68% and 11,626 in favor, 32%.

00:02:00.049 --> 00:02:11.489
Victoria went the other way, 17,523 yes, 62% and 10,890 no, 38% out of 28,413 answers.

00:02:11.949 --> 00:02:16.709
Both places asked the same question on October 17th, do you support Sandwich and Victoria

00:02:16.709 --> 00:02:18.189
